    <data key="d4">OSM roads were filtered to operational truck-accessible edges.  The reference road layers were clipped to the study windows, re-coded to a common schema and matched to OSM edges to add names, tunnel and bridge structure, status and travel direction; posted speeds were assigned from the speed-zone lines; and uncovered reference tunnel segments were added as new edges.</data>
